# Wrapper scopes for `Section7703`

> Module Section7703Wrappers

> Using SaraWorld as W
> Using SaraKinship as K
> Using SaraPredicates as P
> Using Section7703 as Src

Generated by `cutecat_scripts/generate_dataset.py`; edits are
overwritten. Each scope below adds no rule: it declares one input
per parameter of a top-level function of the port and returns what
that function returns. CUTECat explores one entry point per run,
and a top-level function is not one until something names it.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope FnEAmounts:
  input ev content W.Event
  output result content list of money

declaration scope FnPaymentForHousehold:
  input ev content W.Event
  input world content W.World
  input household content W.Entity
  input y content integer
  output result content boolean

declaration scope FnDedupSpouses:
  input l content list of W.Entity
  output result content list of W.Entity

```

```catala
scope FnEAmounts:
  definition result equals Src.e_amounts of ev

scope FnPaymentForHousehold:
  definition result equals Src.payment_for_household of ev, world, household, y

scope FnDedupSpouses:
  definition result equals Src.dedup_spouses of l

```
